Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but you shouldn't sit down at this table.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In the old days they fixed the monkey's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.21,0:00:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,head in the hole in the middle of the table,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,then they cut open the skull and ate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the brain before it died and went cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Today there's something else on the menu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so if you'd like a table over here, I'll take your order.
